  "brain_first": "“先确定题目要哪一种数字；所有听到的数字先暂存，最后决定 才算。”",
  "sort_order": 1004,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 7,
      "sourceIndex": 162
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "题干含 what time, how much, how many, how",
      "sourcePage": 7,
      "sourceIndex": 163
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "long, when, distance, price, discount 等；选项",
      "sourcePage": 7,
      "sourceIndex": 164
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "常只有数字不同。",
      "sourcePage": 7,
      "sourceIndex": 165
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 7,
      "sourceIndex": 166
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "这类题考的不是高深英语，而是数字识别、简单换",
      "sourcePage": 7,
      "sourceIndex": 167
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "算和“信息更新”。",
      "sourcePage": 7,
      "sourceIndex": 168
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “先确定题目要哪一种数字；所有听到的数字先暂存，最后决定",
      "sourcePage": 7,
      "sourceIndex": 169
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "才算。”",
      "sourcePage": 7,
      "sourceIndex": 170
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 对话常先给旧数字，再给折扣、改期、总价或最终数量。",
      "sourcePage": 7,
      "sourceIndex": 171
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 7,
      "sourceIndex": 172
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 录音前先看三个选项，判断差异是“时间/价格/数量/日期”中的哪一种。",
      "sourcePage": 7,
      "sourceIndex": 173
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 听到数字时在草稿上只记最短形式，例如 6:00 → 6:30 、 30 → 25 。",
      "sourcePage": 7,
      "sourceIndex": 174
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 若出现 but, actually, instead, only, another, each，立刻判断是否发生修正或计算。",
      "sourcePage": 7,
      "sourceIndex": 175
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 题目问总数时，把单价/人数/次数关系算完；题目问最终时间时只保留最后确认值。",
      "sourcePage": 7,
      "sourceIndex": 176
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 题号旁只记最短符号：关键词 / old→new / + / - / ?。数字写成“30→25”，计",
      "sourcePage": 7,
      "sourceIndex": 177
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "划写成“drive→sleep”；不要抄完整句。",
      "sourcePage": 7,
      "sourceIndex": 178
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 7,
      "sourceIndex": 179
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· If you hear originally / used to / was → 可能是旧信息。",
      "sourcePage": 7,
      "sourceIndex": 180
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· If you hear now / today / actually / let's make it... → 后面通常是新信息。",
      "sourcePage": 7,
      "sourceIndex": 181
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 题目要求的数字已被最终确认，而且没有后续修正。",
      "sourcePage": 7,
      "sourceIndex": 182
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 没听清完整句子时，不要回忆所有英语，只回忆“题目要的数字前后出现了哪",
      "sourcePage": 7,
      "sourceIndex": 183
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "些单位和改口词”。",
      "sourcePage": 7,
      "sourceIndex": 184
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 7,
      "sourceIndex": 185
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The ticket was $30, but students get $5 off today.",
      "sourcePage": 7,
      "sourceIndex": 186
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "题目问学生今天付多少。先听到30不能选；$5 off表示减5，因此答案是25。",
      "sourcePage": 7,
      "sourceIndex": 187
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 7,
      "sourceIndex": 188
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 听到和选项完全一样的第一个数字就立刻选。",
      "sourcePage": 7,
      "sourceIndex": 189
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 把 half past six 听成 6:15。",
      "sourcePage": 7,
      "sourceIndex": 190
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 题目问总价，却只选了单价。",
      "sourcePage": 8,
      "sourceIndex": 191
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 8,
      "sourceIndex": 192
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 单位对吗？",
      "sourcePage": 8,
      "sourceIndex": 193
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 有没有改口？",
      "sourcePage": 8,
      "sourceIndex": 194
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 问的是“原价”还是“实际支付”？",
      "sourcePage": 8,
      "sourceIndex": 195
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： L-K 关键词漏听｜L-C 改口没更新｜L-P 同",
      "sourcePage": 8,
      "sourceIndex": 196
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "义替换没认出｜L-I 推断过远｜L-A 态度对象/强度错。",
      "sourcePage": 8,
      "sourceIndex": 197
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 8,
      "sourceIndex": 198
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 数字都先记，最后决定才算。",
      "sourcePage": 8,
      "sourceIndex": 199
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 8,
      "sourceIndex": 201
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. The bag was $48, but today it is $36. 今天多少钱？",
      "sourcePage": 8,
      "sourceIndex": 202
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. Meeting was at 2:00; it is moved half an hour later. 新时间？",
      "sourcePage": 8,
      "sourceIndex": 203
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. Two tickets cost $15 each. Total?",
      "sourcePage": 8,
      "sourceIndex": 204
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. A train leaves at 7:45 and arrives 90 minutes later. Arrival?",
      "sourcePage": 8,
      "sourceIndex": 205
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. The room is 120 a night for two nights, with $20 off total. Pay?",
      "sourcePage": 8,
      "sourceIndex": 206
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. $36；2. 2:30；3. $30；4. 9:15；5. $220",
      "sourcePage": 8,
      "sourceIndex": 207
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— L1 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“L1”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 8,
      "sourceIndex": 208
    }
